---
layout: base.njk
title: POAP KINGS | A Clash Royale Clan with Proof
description: "POAP KINGS — a Clash Royale clan built on active, positive play and a roster deep enough to prove it. We publish our data so serious players can see who they're joining."
navActive: home
mainId: top
supercellDisclaimer: true
ogImage: /assets/poapkings.png
ogImageAlt: POAP KINGS crest
ogImageWidth: 1200
ogImageHeight: 1200
---
{%- set members = rosterExplorer.members -%}
{%- set memberCount = clan.memberCount -%}
{%- set openSlots = 50 - memberCount -%}
{%- set totalWins = members | sumBy('wins') -%}
{%- set avgWins = (totalWins / memberCount) | round -%}
{%- set avgTrophies = (clan.totalTrophies / memberCount) | round -%}
{%- set elders = members | whereRole('Elder') | sortByDesc('years') -%}
{%- set scatterPoints = members | homeScatter -%}

<div class="pk-page">

  <section class="pk-hero" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:44px;align-items:center;padding:clamp(44px,6vw,76px) 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);">
    <div>
      <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#d7c8ff;">Clan Tag&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#f5c84c;letter-spacing:.04em;">#{{ site.clanTag }}</span></span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3rem,6.5vw,5.2rem);line-height:1.12;margin:16px 0 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 25%,#d7c8ff 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.25));">POAP<br>KINGS</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.6;color:#c8c1e6;margin:20px 0 0;max-width:30em;text-wrap:pretty;">A <a href="https://clashroyale.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="color:#fff;font-weight:600;">Clash Royale</a> clan built on active, positive play — and a roster deep enough to prove it. We publish our data so serious players can see exactly who they're joining.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/roster/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;min-height:52px;padding:0 26px;border:0;border-radius:14px;background:#6d28d9;color:#f7f4ff;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(109,40,217,.45);" data-tinylytics-event="home.see-roster">See the roster</a>
        <a href="/data/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1rem;min-height:52px;padding:0 26px;border:1.5px solid rgba(215,200,255,.24);border-radius:14px;background:transparent;color:#c8c1e6;" data-tinylytics-event="home.explore-data">Explore the data</a>
      </div>
      <p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:.82rem;color:#c8c1e6;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><span style="color:#22c55e;font-size:1.1em;">↻</span> Data updated {{ roster.updated | formatDate }} from the Clash Royale API.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="border:1px solid rgba(245,200,76,.25);border-radius:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 92% 8%,rgba(245,200,76,.08),transparent 40%),linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(38,22,78,.9),rgba(11,9,32,.94));box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);padding:24px;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px;">
        <img src="/assets/poapkings.png" alt="" style="width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:contain;">
        <div style="display:grid;">
          <span style="font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c8c1e6;">Proof by numbers</span>
          <strong style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;">Roster snapshot</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;">
        {%- set heroStats = [
          { label: 'Clan Trophies', value: clan.clanScore | formatNumber, detail: 'Across all ' + memberCount + ' members' },
          { label: 'Avg Trophies', value: avgTrophies | formatNumber, detail: (clan.totalTrophies | formatNumber) + ' total' },
          { label: 'Donations / week', value: clan.donationsPerWeek | formatNumber, detail: 'Whole-clan generosity' },
          { label: 'Career Wins', value: totalWins | formatNumber, detail: (avgWins | formatNumber) + ' avg per member' }
        ] -%}
        {%- for s in heroStats %}
        <div style="padding:15px 14px;border-radius:14px;">
          <span style="font-size:.62rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c8c1e6;display:block;">{{ s.label }}</span>
          <strong style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1.1;color:#f5c84c;display:block;margin-top:4px;">{{ s.value }}</strong>
          <small style="color:#c8c1e6;font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.3;display:block;margin-top:3px;">{{ s.detail }}</small>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- testimonial -->
  <section style="margin-top:40px;">
    <figure style="margin:0;border:1px solid rgba(245,200,76,.22);border-radius:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 12% 0%,rgba(109,40,217,.28),transparent 45%),rgba(18,13,40,.72);box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);padding:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);">
      <blockquote style="margin:0;font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.6vw,1.85rem);line-height:1.5;color:#f7f4ff;text-wrap:pretty;max-width:26em;">I've been playing Clash Royale for 10 years and I just want to say this is hands down <span style="color:#f5c84c;">THE best clan</span> I've ever been in. Y'all are great!</blockquote>
      <figcaption style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:22px;">
        <div style="display:grid;">
          <strong style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:400;">Th15_Guy</strong>
          <span style="font-size:.76rem;color:#c8c1e6;">Elder · 10 years in Clash Royale · <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#f5c84c;">#QLGYYG0Q</span></span>
        </div>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <!-- requirements -->
  <section class="pk-req-wrap" style="margin-top:40px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.35);border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(59,29,122,.28),rgba(11,9,32,.5));padding:24px 26px;">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;">
        <span style="font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d7c8ff;">Are you a fit? · Requirements</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pk-req4" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:16px;">
      {%- set requirements = [
        { label: 'Min Trophies', value: clan.minTrophies | formatNumber },
        { label: 'Clan Status', value: clan.clanStatus },
        { label: 'Open Slots', value: openSlots + ' of 50' },
        { label: 'War League', value: clan.clanWarTrophies | cwlTier }
      ] -%}
      {%- for r in requirements %}
      <div style="padding:14px;border-radius:13px;">
        <strong style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.3rem;color:#f7f4ff;display:block;">{{ r.value }}</strong>
        <span style="font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c8c1e6;display:block;margin-top:5px;">{{ r.label }}</span>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- mini trend + roster teaser -->
  <section class="pk-split" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:20px;">
    <article style="border:1px solid rgba(215,200,255,.14);border-radius:20px;background:rgba(18,13,40,.72);box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);padding:22px;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;">
        <div>
          <span style="font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c8c1e6;">The whole roster, plotted</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;margin:5px 0 0;">Collection depth × trophies</h3>
        </div>
        <a href="/data/" style="color:#d7c8ff;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;">Full data page →</a>
      </div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 720 280" role="img" aria-label="Scatter plot of each clan member by collection level and trophy count" style="width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:14px;">
        <line x1="60" y1="222" x2="700" y2="222" stroke="rgba(215,200,255,.18)" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <line x1="60" y1="24" x2="60" y2="222" stroke="rgba(215,200,255,.18)" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <text x="380" y="262" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8a83a6" font-size="13" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-weight="700">Collection level →</text>
        <text x="20" y="123" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8a83a6" font-size="13" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-weight="700" transform="rotate(-90 20 123)">Trophies →</text>
        {%- for p in scatterPoints %}
        <circle cx="{{ p.cx }}" cy="{{ p.cy }}" r="6" fill="{{ p.fill }}" stroke="rgba(7,6,16,.6)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.9"></circle>
        {%- endfor %}
      </svg>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:6px;font-size:.76rem;color:#c8c1e6;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;"><i style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c84c;display:inline-block;"></i> Leadership</span>
        <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;"><i style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#d7c8ff;display:inline-block;"></i> Elder</span>
        <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;"><i style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#8b5cf6;display:inline-block;"></i> Member</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article style="border:1px solid rgba(215,200,255,.14);border-radius:20px;background:rgba(18,13,40,.72);box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);padding:22px;">
      <span style="font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c8c1e6;">The backbone of the clan</span>
      <h3 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.15rem;margin:5px 0 4px;">Our Elders</h3>
      <p style="color:#c8c1e6;font-size:.78rem;margin:0 0 14px;">Earned through wars, ranked, and generosity.</p>
      <ol style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:1px;">
        {%- for l in elders | take(6) %}
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:9px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(215,200,255,.08);">
          <span style="min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.92rem;">{{ l.name }}</span>
          <span style="font-size:.72rem;color:#c8c1e6;flex:0 0 auto;">{{ l.years }}y played</span>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ol>
      <a href="/roster/" style="margin-top:14px;display:inline-block;color:#d7c8ff;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;">See full roster →</a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <!-- why join -->
  <section style="margin-top:52px;">
    <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#d7c8ff;">Why join</span>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.1rem);margin:10px 0 0;">Not just another clan</h2>
    <ol class="pk-grid-3" style="list-style:none;margin:24px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;">
      {%- set reasons = [
        { num: '01', title: 'Proof, not hype', body: "Our full roster and clan stats are public and refreshed daily. See exactly who you're joining before you apply — most clans ask you to just trust them." },
        { num: '02', title: 'Structure you can see', body: 'Elder is earned through participation you control — wars, ranked, donations — reviewed every Tuesday, with standings shared openly. No favoritism, no guessing.' },
        { num: '03', title: 'Real, clan-funded rewards', body: 'The top war earner each season gets a free Pass Royale, sent in-game. An actual reward for showing up, not a leaderboard badge.' },
        { num: '04', title: 'Generosity is the flex', body: 'Cards donated every week by the whole clan, with Elders leading by example. Post a request and it fills fast — your upgrades never stall waiting on the clan.' },
        { num: '05', title: 'We build our own tools', body: 'Elixir, our clan agent, runs the data and weekly standings. Elixir Drop, our game, sharpens your play. Almost no clan ships its own software.' },
        { num: '06', title: 'Veteran, drama-free culture', body: 'A veteran roster with real staying power. Wars encouraged, not required — good vibes, and real life always comes first.' }
      ] -%}
      {%- for r in reasons %}
      <li style="border:1px solid rgba(215,200,255,.14);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(18,13,40,.55);padding:22px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#6d28d9;font-size:1.4rem;">{{ r.num }}</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.05rem;margin:8px 0 6px;">{{ r.title }}</h3>
        <p style="color:#c8c1e6;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0;">{{ r.body }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- built by POAP KINGS -->
  <section style="margin-top:52px;">
    <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#d7c8ff;">Built by POAP KINGS</span>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.1rem);margin:10px 0 0;">We build our own tools</h2>
    <div class="pk-grid-2" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:24px;">
      <a href="/elixir/" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.5);border-radius:20px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 88% 12%,rgba(245,60,255,.2),transparent 42%),linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(88,28,235,.4),rgba(38,22,78,.7));box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;color:inherit;">
        <div>
          <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c84c;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(245,200,76,.14);">Our clan agent</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.5rem;margin:12px 0 8px;">Meet Elixir</h3>
          <p style="color:#e7e2f7;line-height:1.6;margin:0;">Built by and for POAP KINGS, Elixir is our clan agent — publishing the weekly Elder Standing, tracking every member's stats, and welcoming recruits. The data on this site runs through Elixir.</p>
          <span style="margin-top:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.9rem;color:#f5c84c;">Meet Elixir →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://drop.poapkings.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid rgba(245,200,76,.28);border-radius:20px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 12% 90%,rgba(109,40,217,.3),transparent 45%),linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(38,22,78,.85),rgba(11,9,32,.92));box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);padding:28px;color:inherit;">
        <div>
          <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c84c;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(245,200,76,.14);">Our game</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:1.5rem;margin:12px 0 8px;">Elixir Drop</h3>
          <p style="color:#c8c1e6;line-height:1.6;margin:0;">A fast little game we built and run to help players learn Clash Royale cards and elixir costs — and get quicker at reading the field.</p>
        </div>
        <span style="margin-top:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.9rem;color:#f5c84c;">Play Elixir Drop →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- final join -->
  <section style="margin:56px 0 72px;border:1px solid rgba(245,200,76,.25);border-radius:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgba(245,200,76,.1),transparent 38%),linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(38,22,78,.9),rgba(11,9,32,.95));box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);padding:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:32px;align-items:center;" class="pk-split">
    <div>
      <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#d7c8ff;">Ready?</span>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.02;margin:12px 0 0;">{% if openSlots > 0 %}We're invite only.<br>{{ openSlots }} spot{{ 's' if openSlots != 1 }} left.{% else %}We're invite only.<br>The clan is full.{% endif %}</h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#c8c1e6;margin:16px 0 0;">If you've got {{ clan.minTrophies | formatNumber }}+ trophies and show up for war, apply in-game and leadership will review it. See you in Discord.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dl style="margin:0;display:grid;gap:1px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;"><dt style="color:#c8c1e6;font-size:.85rem;">Clan Tag</dt><dd style="margin:0;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;color:#f5c84c;">#{{ site.clanTag }}</dd></div>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;"><dt style="color:#c8c1e6;font-size:.85rem;">Region</dt><dd style="margin:0;">{{ clan.clanRegion }}</dd></div>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;"><dt style="color:#c8c1e6;font-size:.85rem;">Type</dt><dd style="margin:0;">{{ clan.clanStatus }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <button type="button" data-modal-open="join" data-tinylytics-event="home.join" style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;min-height:50px;padding:0 24px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:0;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5c84c,#c98c10);color:#2a1500;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(245,200,76,.35);">JOIN</button>
        <a href="{{ site.discordUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="font-family:'Supercell Magic',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;min-height:50px;padding:0 24px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:14px;border:1.5px solid rgba(215,200,255,.24);color:#c8c1e6;">Open Discord</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
